# Firebase native config — contains project API keys. Kept out of committed source.
# For local builds these sit at the paths referenced by app.config.js; for EAS cloud
# builds they are injected as file secrets (see app.config.js for the commands).
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# Native projects are generated by `expo prebuild`, not hand-maintained. Committing
# them pins EAS to the bare workflow, where app.config.js never runs — the checked-in
# android/ predated Firebase, so it carried no google-services gradle plugin and
# signed release builds with the debug keystore (Play rejects those). Leaving them
# untracked lets EAS prebuild per profile and inject its own release keystore.
/android
/ios
